# Staged deployment journals can be placed next to any user-selected manifest.
# The Foundry cache contains private resume data; broadcasts may include RPC
# routing details. Keep public manifests/reports and unrelated fixtures visible.
**/*-private/*/cache/
**/*-broadcast/*/DeployFederation.s.sol/
